<style>
.hiw-section {
  padding: 100px 24px;
  background: #000;
  border-top: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
}
.hiw-header {
  text-align: center;
  max-width: 500px;
  margin: 0 auto 60px;
}
.hiw-header h2 {
  font-size: clamp(24px, 3.5vw, 38px);
  font-weight: 900;
  color: #fff;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  letter-spacing: -1px;
}
.hiw-header p {
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  font-size: 16px;
}
.hiw-steps {
  max-width: 1000px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 1px;
  background: #1a1a1a;
}
.hiw-step {
  background: #000;
  padding: 48px 32px;
  text-align: center;
}
.hiw-step-number {
  font-size: 48px;
  font-weight: 900;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  line-height: 1;
}
.hiw-step h3 {
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: #fff;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
}
.hiw-step p {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  line-height: 1.6;
}
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .hiw-steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .hiw-section { padding: 60px 20px; }
}
</style>

<section class="hiw-section" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="hiw-header">
    <h2>How It Works</h2>
    <p>Three steps. Zero complications.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="hiw-steps">
    <div class="hiw-step">
      <div class="hiw-step-number">01</div>
      <h3>Slip It On</h3>
      <p>No hooks. No wires. Pull it over your head and adjust the straps.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hiw-step">
      <div class="hiw-step-number">02</div>
      <h3>Feel The Pull</h3>
      <p>X-back tension bands align your shoulders instantly. You'll feel it working.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hiw-step">
      <div class="hiw-step-number">03</div>
      <h3>Stand Tall</h3>
      <p>Within days, better posture becomes natural. Pain-free, confident, transformed.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "How It Works",
  "presets": [{"name": "How It Works"}]
}
{% endschema %}